<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xylan cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xylan cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Xylan Corp to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Cited accumulation of excess inventories of Xylan products at customer International Business Machines Corp. &quot;While sources suggest that this inventory glut is already improving, Xylan management is now very conservative with their outlook.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Cut fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $0.51 per share from $0.71.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-1/4 to 15.</p>
</text>
